{"version":1,"key":"card:135","content":{"id":135,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"GSAP 是一个动画库，引用官网的一段话"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Animation ultimately boils down to changing property values many times per second, making something appear to move, fade, spin, etc."}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"动画的实质就是在一秒内多次改变属性值，GSAP 就是做这个工作的，在给定起始值和终止值时，GSAP 可以在 1s 内做 60 次插值。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"GSAP 可以对以下属性进行插值："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 属性，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"width","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"borderRadius","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"color","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SVG 属性，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"viewBox","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"stroke","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fill","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以通过额外的插件对路径进行变形动画"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"任何数值，GSAP 可以对任意对象中的数值属性进行插值"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/三方库/GSAP"],"createTime":1689489905013,"updateTime":1772280323941,"linkedCards":[{"id":136,"target":{"key":"card:136","type":"card","id":136},"summary":"在项目中使用 GSAP 通过 script 标签引入 CDN，然后就可以在代码中访问 gsap 了 <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.10.4/gsap.m...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/GSAP"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1772280323941}}